<h2>Profile</h2>
<p>Software engineer with 12+ years of professional experience designing and modernizing production systems. My background includes .NET and cloud architecture, distributed infrastructure, payments, domain-driven design, developer enablement, and full-stack product delivery. I combine deep implementation with architectural guidance and cross-team collaboration.</p>
<h2>Selected impact</h2>
<ul>
<li>Built a remote infrastructure management and update-delivery system operating across 2,000+ servers.</li>
<li>Designed a distributed API usage logging pipeline with a 99.9% delivery SLA.</li>
<li>Delivered a containerized Card Account Updater microservice for subscription continuity in a payments platform.</li>
<li>Led or contributed substantially to an incremental Azure App Service migration spanning container readiness, managed identity, Key Vault, CI/CD, staging validation, authentication, and reversible cutover.</li>
<li>Built workflow/rules capabilities using DDD and CQRS; led workshops, reviewed architecture across teams, and codified implementation guidance with a canonical domain-model reference slice.</li>
<li>Supported a major product-generation transition through catalog and pricing changes, product identity, components, drawings, search, and administration workflows.</li>
</ul>
